🚀 Day 22 – Palindrome Number
📌 Problem Statement
Given an integer, determine whether the number reads the same forward and backward.
💡 Approach
Reverse the digits of the given number using the modulus % and integer division // operators. Compare the reversed number with the original number. If both are equal, the number is a palindrome.
⏱️ Complexity Analysis
Time Complexity: O(d)
Space Complexity: O(1)
